    narration: 'At t = 0 the container contains only N2O4, so the vial is nearly colorless. The NO2 concentration begins near zero, while N2O4 starts high.',
    quantity: 'Concentration',
    initial: 1,
    t: 0
  },
  {
    title: 'Watch the mixture approach equilibrium',
    narration: 'Drag the time marker to the middle of the graph: N2O4 is being consumed, NO2 is forming, and the vial becomes more orange-brown. The concentrations are still changing, so equilibrium has not yet been reached.',
    quantity: 'Concentration',
    initial: 1,
    t: 0.34
  },
  {
    title: 'Connect plateaus to rate equality',
    narration: 'Switch to the rate graph at the same time position. The forward rate falls as N2O4 is depleted, while the reverse rate rises as NO2 accumulates.',
    quantity: 'Rate',
    initial: 1,
    t: 0.34
  },
  {
    title: 'Equilibrium is dynamic',
    narration: 'Past the dashed line, the concentration curves are flat and the rate curves overlap. Molecules still interconvert, but the forward and reverse processes occur at equal rates.',
    quantity: 'Rate',
